WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:02.016 --> 00:00:03.683
TONY STARK
Yeah, peace! I love peace.

00:00:03.688 --> 00:00:05.005
I'd be out of a job with peace.

00:00:08.913 --> 00:00:09.913
[Screams]

00:00:12.140 --> 00:00:13.140
[Gasps]

00:00:13.678 --> 00:00:15.865
[Device beeping]

00:00:20.857 --> 00:00:22.420
TONY STARK
Do we know each other?

00:00:22.420 --> 00:00:25.086
♪♪

00:00:25.092 --> 00:00:26.175
ANCIENT ONE
Time.

00:00:30.850 --> 00:00:31.850
ANCIENT ONE
Reality.

00:00:33.443 --> 00:00:35.110
DOCTOR STRANGE
[Screams]

00:00:37.162 --> 00:00:38.662
ANCIENT ONE
It's changeable.

00:00:41.208 --> 00:00:43.168
♪♪

00:00:43.178 --> 00:00:44.595
YONDU UDONTA
Where you wanna be...

00:00:46.710 --> 00:00:48.710
That's the question, isn't it?

00:00:49.415 --> 00:00:51.415
ULTRON
Every universe...

00:00:53.736 --> 00:00:55.486
...is different.

00:00:55.478 --> 00:00:59.020
Each one unique.

00:01:02.052 --> 00:01:03.135
THOR
Slow down a little bit.

00:01:03.145 --> 00:01:05.646
There's a few people in
the room that don't understand...

00:01:05.645 --> 00:01:06.896
Not me, I get it.

00:01:13.122 --> 00:01:14.164
DOCTOR STRANGE
Who are you?

00:01:15.127 --> 00:01:17.127
PEGGY CARTER
The name's Captain Carter.

00:01:18.729 --> 00:01:19.979
DR. ARNIM ZOLA
Scheisse!

00:01:21.651 --> 00:01:23.189
THE WATCHER
I am the Watcher.

00:01:24.510 --> 00:01:27.177
I observe all that transpires here.

00:01:27.971 --> 00:01:31.930
But I do not, cannot,
will not interfere.

00:01:35.109 --> 00:01:37.109
ERIK KILLMONGER
I guess I have to freestyle then.

00:01:38.765 --> 00:01:40.391
QUEEN RAMONDA
Charge!

00:01:40.539 --> 00:01:41.373
SCOTT LANG
Hey!

00:01:42.128 --> 00:01:43.587
KREE SOLDIER
We have you outnumbered.

00:01:43.589 --> 00:01:46.673
T'CHALLA
A Ravager never flies solo...

00:01:47.858 --> 00:01:51.359
I said, never flies solo!

00:01:51.376 --> 00:01:54.126
KREE SOLDIER
Uh...  Is that some kind of catchphrase?

00:01:54.134 --> 00:01:56.801
[Whistling]

00:01:57.659 --> 00:01:59.701
YONDU UDONTA
[Whistling]

00:01:59.728 --> 00:02:01.395
T'CHALLA
You had me worried for a second.

00:02:03.330 --> 00:02:04.913
THE WATCHER
Journey to face the unknown,

00:02:05.790 --> 00:02:07.524
and ponder the question...

00:02:09.736 --> 00:02:12.914
♪♪

